514	- [ ] Grid layouts collapse to single column
515	- [ ] Badge/pill text contrasts with background
516	- [ ] Color swatches have visible borders
517	- [ ] Touch targets are 44x44px minimum
518	- [ ] Font sizes are 16px+ to prevent iOS zoom
519	- [ ] Navigation has mobile menu pattern
